t":"When bumping marketplace action majors or changing job graph / path filters / Bazel commands in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, update `.gitea/workflows/ci.yml` in the **same PR**."},"839":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-39","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#parity-policy","content":"Enforced by `tests/bats/tooling.bats` (`//tests:bats_tooling_test`):"},"840":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-40","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#parity-policy","content":"Same job ids and path-filter keys"},"841":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-41","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#parity-policy","content":"Same critical commands (`//:test-fast`, hermetic modes, docs render, gate script)"},"842":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-42","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#parity-policy","content":"Same marketplace action **major** pins (`actions/checkout@vN`, etc.)"},"843":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-43","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#parity-policy","content":"Allowed Gitea-only delta: a short header comment that the file is a Forgejo/Gitea mirror."},"844":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-44","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"GitHub-only"},"845":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-45","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Why not mirrored"},"846":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-46","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"`.github/workflows/deploy-docs.yml`"},"847":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-47","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Fumadocs static export → GitHub Pages (`gh-pages`, `.nojekyll`). Needs a chosen Gitea Pages / static host + secrets before a Gitea equivalent exists."},"848":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-48","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"`.github/workflows/publish-images.yml`"},"849":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-49","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Digest-then-manifest publish to GHCR (`GITHUB_TOKEN` + `packages: write`). Gitea has no GHCR; keep building `lab-*:local` on the node until a registry is chosen."},"850":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-50","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"`.github/dependabot.yml`"},"851":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-51","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Dependabot is a GitHub product; use Renovate or manual bumps on Gitea. On GitHub it must open PRs against `development` (`target-branch`), not `main`. Enforced by `tests/bats/tooling.bats`."},"852":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-52","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Docker Buildx still uses `cache-from/to: type=gha` for structural parity with GitHub. On pure `gitea-act-runner` hosts the GHA cache backend may no-op; prefer a persistent local Docker layer cache or registry cache on the runner if rebuilds stay cold."},"853":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-53","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Runner labels may differ (configure in Gitea)."},"854":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-54","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Secrets and variables are configured in Gitea UI (use the same logical names where applicable)."},"855":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-55","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"For self-hosted, ensure docker or the execution environment has the tools Bazel and hermetic dashboard tests need."},"856":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-56","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Caching: mount persistent volumes for Bazel disk/repo caches; use `actions/cache` for npm/pip/Playwright when supported."},"857":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-57","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Docs **publish** stays on GitHub Pages unless you add a separate Gitea deploy workflow."},"858":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-58","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Use the shipped `.gitea/workflows/ci.yml` (do not regress to a single job)."},"859":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-59","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Self-hosted runners (`gitea-act-runner` or compatible): mount persistent volume for `~/.cache/bazel-disk` and `~/.cache/bazel-repo` (and node\\_modules) for large cache hits across builds (key on `MODULE.bazel.lock` / `.bazelversion`)."},"860":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-60","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Use `actions/cache` for the same keys as GitHub where the runner supports it."},"861":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-61","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Runner labels: configure in Gitea admin (e.g. `self-hosted`, `linux`); use in `runs-on`."},"862":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-62","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Keep `.bazelrc` `--config=ci` for CI-oriented flags; raise resources on beefy self-hosted hardware as needed."},"863":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-63","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"See also `.github/workflows/ci.yml` and `.bazelrc` for cache/parallel flags."},"864":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-64","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#caching--parallelism-tips-for-gitea","content":"Bazel: restore disk + repo cache in job steps (see `.bazelrc` and `setup-bazel`)."},"865":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-65","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#caching--parallelism-tips-for-gitea","content":"Non-hermetic: separate npm cache (`setup-node`), Python (`setup-python` cache)."},"866":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-66","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#caching--parallelism-tips-for-gitea","content":"Parallel: jobs run concurrently; self-hosted can run multiple in parallel (configure runner capacity)."},"867":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-67","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#caching--parallelism-tips-for-gitea","content":"For visuals/goldens: pre-install Playwright browsers in the runner image or cache `~/.cache/ms-playwright`."},"868":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-68","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#caching--parallelism-tips-for-gitea","content":"Docs **build** in CI: `bazelisk run //docs:docs --config=ci` then `bazelisk run //docs-site:visual --config=ci` (same as GitHub); the visual job needs the Chromium that `npx playwright install` provides in the runner image or cache. Publish remains GitHub-only today."},"869":{"id":"/glossary","page_id":"/glossary","type":"page","content":"Glossary","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":["glossary","concepts","education"],"url":"/glossary"},"870":{"id":"/glossary-0","page_id":"/glossary","tags":["glossary","concepts","education"],"type":"text","url":"/glossary","content":"Lab terminology with short definitions and links to deeper concept pages — educational companion to in-page tooltips."},"871":{"id":"/glossary-1","page_id":"/glossary","type":"heading","tags":["glossary","concepts","education"],"url":"/glossary#glossary","content":"Glossary"},"872":{"id":"/glossary-2","page_id":"/glossary","type":"heading","tags":["glossary","concepts","education"],"url":"/glossary#core-lab-concepts","content":"Core lab concepts"},"873":{"id":"/glossary-3","page_id":"/glossary","type":"heading","tags":["glossary","concepts","education"],"url":"/glossary#cluster--platfor